						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><span style="font-size:150%;">“新起之秀”新人竞赛</span></span></h2> <p><span style="font-size:50%;">原名“<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/forum/t-10017812/">龙争虎斗</a>”</span></p> <p><em>你的作品将被所有人歌颂</em></p> </div> <div class="terminal"> <div class="scanline"></div> <div class="text"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">优胜者已经诞生！让我们祝贺——</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> </div> <div style="background: #FFD031; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px black; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="background: white; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px black; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:140%;"><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1936">SCP-CN-1936</a> - 已经不存在了</strong></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:116%;">分数：<strong>77</strong>（+81/-4）</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">作者：Whlie rock、<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-lancelot" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3494246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="A Lancelot" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3494246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-lancelot" >A Lancelot</a></span></span></p> </div> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><em>到决断的时候了。</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div style="background:#DCDCDC ; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px black; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="background: white; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px black; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:140%;"><strong><