ext-decoration: underline;">均已获奖</span>。请移步<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/prime-sponsor-list">赞助列表</a>参看有关奖品领取的详细信息。</td> </tr> </table> <h1><span>当前赛事流程</span></h1> <ol> <li>请<em>获奖选手</em>参考<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/prime-sponsor-list">赞助列表</a>以进行接下来的奖品选取流程。</li> <li>请所有以特殊方式发布的人员对自己的作品进行备份，备份方式为点击页面右下角的“+ 选项”→“页面源代码”，并复制备份源代码中所有文本。<em>所有的</em>此类临时页面已进行统一删除，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">承办人员已尽量将所有未及时备份的作品保存至此。</span></li> <li>请以特殊方式发布的<em>正分</em>作品作者联系承办人员以讨论是否将作品转为正式作品。</li> </ol> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th colspan="4">承办人员联系方式</th> </tr> <tr> <th>担任职务</th> <th>用户</th> <th>称呼</th> <th>联系方式（QQ）</th> </tr> <tr> <td>竞赛主办人</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/day-by-die" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3626255&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="day by die" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3626255)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/day-by-die" >day by die</a></span></td> <td>老安</td> <td>2723730701</td> </tr> <tr> <td>该页面负责人</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662223&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="pokm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662223)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" >pokm</a></span></td> <td>龙裔</td> <td>2128755759</td> </tr> <tr> <td>群聊“创作指导”负责人</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4008607&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="62ECN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4008607)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/62ecn" >62ECN</a></span></td> <td>62</td> <td>970208699</td> </tr> <tr> <td>稿件收集整理</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swxx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4504795&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="swxx" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4504795)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swxx" >swxx</a></span></td> <td>失望</td> <td>1024112341</td> </tr> </table> <h1><span>参赛条目：</span></h1> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;"> <p>请所有参赛选手联系<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662223&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608124638" alt="pokm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662223)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokm" >pokm</a></span>QQ：2128755759或wikidot私信以讨论领奖及作品后续事宜。</p> </div> <p>下列模组显示的为各作品的即时信息。“作者”一栏显示为页面创建者，因此特殊方式发布的作品作者将显示为承办人员。</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;竞赛结果截图</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏竞赛结果截图</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/prime-contest-hub/prime-contest-result" alt="prime-contest-result" class="image" /> <p>由于承办人员工作失误，截至竞赛结束时未能及时删除SCP-CN-1175的标题，导致无法使用模组统计其分数，已通过查询<a href="http://scpper.com/page/598125853">scpper</a>核实其得分为10（+15/-5），排名为第45，特此致歉。</p> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/prime-contest-hub/prime-contest-result-cn-1175" alt="prime-contest-result-cn-1175" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="ja